{"summary":"Exciting merging game! Make it bigger.","description":"Merge small dinosaur eggs to create a giant dinosaur. Try this simple, enjoyable game that you can play anywhere, anytime!\n\n[How to Play]\n- Aim where to drop.\n- Touch anywhere on the screen to aim.\n- Merge the same shapes to make them bigger.\n- The more you merge, the more points you get.\n\n[Various Skins]\n- Change skins at 11 different levels.\n- Familiar fruits turn into a watermelon.\n- Cute animals turn into an elephant.\n- Majestic planets become the sun.\n- Delicious foods turn into pizza.\n- Collect skins to receive special rewards.\n\n[Features]\n- Playable with one hand, anywhere.\n- Can be played offline.\n- Easy controls and simple rules.\n- Compete in weekly rankings with people from around the world!\n- Collect various skins.\n- Supports tablet play.\n\nHelp : cs@mobirix.com\n\nHomepage :\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=4864673505117639552","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $99.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iGgzzd8Mvm0?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7YG0U6xPBMAOuvhOqheWbdY0psq_CkKgurp51O04TMCElYuccKwvPUIvTfvoZJnnQjD1GykPuIVPYNMFlCO_","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/40eDqmAStyE0JbZ8-gHYhndp1yvuvZ1z9oMPph765RgDKR1InH6fyATa4E_mLAxWeyGubXVo_G_cS2DRrOv36Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/K8y3KFdirCdu9izuQ-HvwgyOPdpk7sHfC4ezZC62K9YokamVCb_4yo69arqJaPgOPzr7--ElVTk-xo8OEAzs","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-amvmHtFW4KScNkfBoo3rORyaGvq2b8YOZAh0IXhTI2nWUJ-tOiyWWFmc1WIf4IbfQubf-RJ4VJaMnlrBZ1TnQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k7Kl6ubVnymix-AMGr7J3O0kFOR19pANlKoO9vGWWRAJ4in9uQpMQx9lDNpwF-zRI2UrptuU-RpJgkEzQWP8UQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GkPSL-92YfAB2mCOZPlkq-U2vMfu0BqMRNyFpF9K_HZIO9r-wRRo37um9C1yFq8gw5Zm3yFOdsC1sjsFPcV-","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_S3MMXDQMGWgJBIOKCdANefpNapwUzUNrrFCN0y_oeDQPFe_JpvtgN4yqrHDy0He8JiN